### 1. Get Active Categories
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get Category by ID - Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories/999999
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get All Categories - Admin
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/categories
Accept: application/json

### 4. Create Category - Success
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Electronics",
  "description": "Electronic products",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 5. Create Category - Duplicate Name
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Electronics",
  "description": "Another electronics category",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 6. Update Category - Success
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Electronics",
  "description": "Electronic devices and accessories",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 7. Create Second Category
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Clothing",
  "description": "Clothing products",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 8. Update Category - Duplicate Name
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/categories/2
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Electronics",
  "description": "Updated clothing description",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 9. Verify Category 2 After Failed Update
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories/2
Accept: application/json

### 10. Deactivate Category
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/categories/2
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Clothing",
  "description": "Clothing products",
  "status": "INACTIVE"
}

### 11. Verify Public Categories
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### 12. Verify Admin Categories
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/categories
Accept: application/json

### 13. Delete Category - Success
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/admin/categories/2

### 14. Verify Deleted Category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories/2
Accept: application/json

### 15. Delete Category - Conflict When Product Exists
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/admin/categories/1

### 16. Verify Category Still Exists After Conflict
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories/1
Accept: application/json

### 17. Delete Non-existing Category
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/admin/categories/999999

### 18. Create Category - Empty Name
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   ",
  "description": "Invalid category",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 19. Create Category - Missing Status
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Missing Status",
  "description": "Invalid category"
}

### 20. Create Category - Name Exceeds Maximum Length
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "This category name is intentionally made longer than one hundred characters to test the maximum allowed length validation rule",
  "description": "Invalid category",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 21. Create Category - Invalid Status
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Invalid Status Category",
  "description": "Invalid category status",
  "status": "UNKNOWN"
}
